(7694317, 1261474, 67145, '<td valign="top">i was told early on not to look thru the viewfinder when using a dslr as the sun can really do damage to your eyes .. now i use mirrorless a lot of the time and i''ve heard that the sun cant damage your eyes when looking thru the viewfinder using mirrorless  .. i do believe the former .. but the latter i''m not totally sure of .. <br/>even with that knowledge i did look thru the viewfinder pointing at the sun when using my dslr .. there are some shots you just have to get .. ;)<br/>i''m not blind .. but i may be lucky .. <br/>i rather like this shot .. and its perfect for the challenge .. its actually hurting my eyes looking at it .. :)</td>', 'i was told early on not to look thru the viewfinder when using a dslr as the sun can really do damage to your eyes .. now i use mirrorless a lot of the time and i''ve heard that the sun cant damage your eyes when looking thru the viewfinder using mirrorless  .. i do believe the former .. but the latter i''m not totally sure of .. even with that knowledge i did look thru the viewfinder pointing at the sun when using my dslr .. there are some shots you just have to get .. ;)i''m not blind .. but i may be lucky .. i rather like this shot .. and its perfect for the challenge .. its actually hurting my eyes looking at it .. :)', '2021-05-15 18:05:17.000000', NULL, 1),
