(7694715, 1261342, 87808, '<td valign="top">I love the clutter too, I can see where they are coming from as it seems you have to scroll down to see the bird, but when seen as a whole picture, it is very pretty. It reminded me of an expensive wall paper.<br/> <br/>But yes, the crop would have helped for DPC<br/></td>', 'I love the clutter too, I can see where they are coming from as it seems you have to scroll down to see the bird, but when seen as a whole picture, it is very pretty. It reminded me of an expensive wall paper. But yes, the crop would have helped for DPC', '2021-05-21 23:35:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(7694725, 1261342, 68504, '<td valign="top">yeah, well, the crop would have done a disservice to art.  (do you really want to be on the front page with the Big Bird People?)</td>', 'yeah, well, the crop would have done a disservice to art.  (do you really want to be on the front page with the Big Bird People?)', '2021-05-22 01:35:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(7694732, 1261342, 87808, '<td valign="top">lol <img border="0" src="https://www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif" xalt="'' . substr(''https://www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''https://www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''"/> <a href="https://www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=68504" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">tnun</a> <br/> <br/>I like my clutter/ excessive top part,  as I said  it reminds me of exotic expensive wallpaper. For DPC, yes, a crop would probably be great idea, but I personally loved the top half, as to me, it brought it al together. But I like my tunnel of darkness, I pied to no one, but myself. Probably why, all my recent photos are 5-. I like what I have done. And I am at the point that , if it makes me happy or evokes a nice feeling,  then it is good enough for me. Not DPC.</td>', 'lol  tnun  I like my clutter/ excessive top part,  as I said  it reminds me of exotic expensive wallpaper. For DPC, yes, a crop would probably be great idea, but I personally loved the top half, as to me, it brought it al together. But I like my tunnel of darkness, I pied to no one, but myself. Probably why, all my recent photos are 5-. I like what I have done. And I am at the point that , if it makes me happy or evokes a nice feeling,  then it is good enough for me. Not DPC.', '2021-05-22 01:54:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(7694735, 1261342, 87808, '<td valign="top">And <img border="0" src="https://www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif" xalt="'' . substr(''https://www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''https://www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''"/> <a href="https://www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=35639" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">efaulk</a> We are not picking on you, or on our comments. It is a valid comment and one I can agree on in terms of DPC. <br/> <br/>Please do not think you are being singled out, as we talk about this photo. <br/> <br/>There is DPC photos, then there is, I am so over it, this makes me smile and makes me happy for my own reasons photo that meets the challenge. That is where I am right now.</td>', 'And  efaulk We are not picking on you, or on our comments. It is a valid comment and one I can agree on in terms of DPC.  Please do not think you are being singled out, as we talk about this photo.  There is DPC photos, then there is, I am so over it, this makes me smile and makes me happy for my own reasons photo that meets the challenge. That is where I am right now.', '2021-05-22 01:59:41.000000', NULL, 0),
